[00:46.96]Everybody knows how I feel about you
[00:54.65]So you can act surprised if you need to
[01:02.60]And I am still your friend if you think it's worth it
[01:10.45]It just means that I'll see you when I see you
[01:17.54]
[01:34.73]I could not deny it was overwhelming
[01:42.44]Living out our lives for just one thing
[01:50.18]And right now I would love to put my arms around you
[01:58.33]Even if I know it would mean nothing (Nothing)
[02:06.86]
[02:06.88]I know I can seem uncaring in moments like these
[02:14.54]I just hope it's enough to say my words don't come with ease
[02:22.36]And I'm sure that you won't believe but you'll be on my mind
[02:30.28]I waited till the end of summer and I ran out of time
[02:38.12]
[02:38.14]Do it on my own
[02:39.62]Goin' through it on my own
[02:41.60]It's a feeling in my bones
[02:43.52]Can we do it tomorrow?
